OL,3,AHundreds remember synagogue attack
OL,4,Avictims
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Chief Rabbi Ephraim Mirvis and
OL,7,FCommunities Secretary Angela Rayner
OL,8,Fwere among about 800 people who
OL,9,Fattended a memorial event for the
OL,10,Fvictims and survivors of last year's
OL,11,FHeaton Park synagogue attack.
OL,13,FMelvin Cravitz and Adrian Daulby were
OL,14,Fkilled, and three others injured, as
OL,15,Fthey tried to defend their place of
OL,16,Fworship from attacker Jihad al-Shamie
OL,17,Fon 2 October 2025.
OL,19,FRelatives of the bereaved and some of
OL,20,Fthe survivors were among the speakers
OL,21,Fat Monday's service of remembrance at
OL,22,Fthe synagogue in Manchester.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
